  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa - Regional  Mpox Epidemic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The extended appeal outlines a multi-tiered strategy for National Societies to respond to the epidemic. The approach includes community-based health promotion, disease surveillance, mental health support, clinical care, and vaccination, as well as water, sanitation, and hygiene initiatives. Additionally, there is a focus on socio-economic protection for affected individuals through cash assistance and livelihood support.</narrative>
  </description>
